{
 "_doc": "Tier-2 county campground on a gravel road in the woods south of Route 9 (region D6), across the road from the Ashen watch camp. Three small kit buildings in a yard of tent sites: the fee station and the camp host's trailer wear shell props (out_kiosk_shell, out_host_trailer_shell: their walls stand outside the kit walls, openings where the plan's doors and windows are), the concrete-block shower house wears a roof prop (out_block_roof); style roof 'none'. The loop road is a region road over the pad. Trees (out_tree_*: the vegetation models as props) stand in the pad the composer clears. Route: the gravel road -> the fee station (its window smashed; the register) -> the sites, the Haldanes' motorhome -> the host's trailer, padlocked -> the shower house: the men's side chained, the women's side a ward (opening it wakes the sick on their cots) -> the utility room, Bev under her key hook (taking the keys wakes the men's side, who come through the hole they knocked in the block wall) -> back to the trailer: Bev's battery alarm on the bedroom door -> the bedroom (Gus guards the lockbox) -> the bolted back door. Site 5 is closed for Gus's traps. See docs/POI_AUTHORING.md.",
